<title>USA: Alleghany sets 1997 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Alleghany sets 1997 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alleghany Corp said Wednesday it declared a stock dividend consisting of one share of Alleghany common stock for every 50 shares outstanding as the company's 1997 annual dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>The dividend will be distributed on April 25 to holders of record on April 1. The company said it will pay cash in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>It also paid a two percent stock dividend last April.</p>
</text>
